flowchart TD
    %% Game flow: what the player sees, from opening the game to the end of a round

    Start(["Open the game"])
    Setup["Choose a difficulty (sets the number range and the attempt limit) and turn the AI Game Master on or off"]
    NewRound["New round: a secret number is picked, score starts at 100, attempts at 0"]
    Guess["Player types a guess and clicks Submit"]
    Count["The attempt is counted"]
    Valid{"Whole number inside the range?"}
    Invalid["Error message. Costs 5 points. No hint"]
    Compare{"Compare the guess with the secret"}
    Wrong["Too high or too low: costs 5 points"]
    OutOf{"All attempts used up?"}
    Lost["Game over: score is 0 and the secret is revealed. No hint"]
    Hint["Hint: go higher or lower. In the Game Master's voice with the AI on, plain text with it off"]
    Won["Win: balloons, the remaining score is kept. The Game Master states the secret and the score, or a plain message with the AI off"]
    Again(["New Game button"])

    Start --> Setup
    Setup --> NewRound
    NewRound --> Guess
    Guess --> Count
    Count --> Valid
    Valid -->|"no"| Invalid
    Valid -->|"yes"| Compare
    Compare -->|"correct"| Won
    Compare -->|"wrong"| Wrong
    Invalid --> OutOf
    Wrong --> OutOf
    OutOf -->|"yes"| Lost
    OutOf -->|"no"| Hint
    Hint --> Guess
    Won --> Again
    Lost --> Again
    Again --> NewRound
    Guess -.->|"changing the difficulty mid-round starts a new round"| NewRound
